(6445685, 956953, 121949, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, and you photographed the model perfectly. I only wish the missing puzzle pieces followed the shape of her face instead of lying flat. Don''t ask me how you would have done it though.</td>', 'This was a good idea, and you photographed the model perfectly. I only wish the missing puzzle pieces followed the shape of her face instead of lying flat. Don''t ask me how you would have done it though.', '2011-06-17 02:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
