(6445692, 957079, 121949, '<td valign="top">I understand what you are trying to convey here. It''s hard to get people to connect to a photo with just objects. Adding a person or more perspective to this shot in my opinion would take this photo a notch higher. Also since the cross is the main focal point of your photo its a bit soft on focus. Great message though.</td>', 'I understand what you are trying to convey here. It''s hard to get people to connect to a photo with just objects. Adding a person or more perspective to this shot in my opinion would take this photo a notch higher. Also since the cross is the main focal point of your photo its a bit soft on focus. Great message though.', '2011-06-17 02:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445693, 957142, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea, I wish we could see the landscape a bit more. I don''t know if this was taken in one shot or separate exposures, since this is advanced editing. but the landscape need a bit longer shutter time and the moon needs a bit less. I''ve heard of blocking out parts of the photo during long exposures but I have never tried it myself.</td>', 'This is a cool idea, I wish we could see the landscape a bit more. I don''t know if this was taken in one shot or separate exposures, since this is advanced editing. but the landscape need a bit longer shutter time and the moon needs a bit less. I''ve heard of blocking out parts of the photo during long exposures but I have never tried it myself.', '2011-06-17 02:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445694, 956811, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Love the tones.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Love the tones.', '2011-06-17 02:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
