(6447185, 957072, 3585, '<td valign="top">I used to know a lady that shower heads inspired.<br/>Very strange &amp; unsettling montage here.</td>', 'I used to know a lady that shower heads inspired.Very strange & unsettling montage here.', '2011-06-19 07:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447186, 957222, 3585, '<td valign="top">And she makes me colorblind.</td>', 'And she makes me colorblind.', '2011-06-19 07:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447187, 956451, 3585, '<td valign="top">Do you take pictures while you sleep?</td>', 'Do you take pictures while you sleep?', '2011-06-19 07:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447188, 956883, 3585, '<td valign="top">Sublime junk.<br/>Hope the song is up to it!</td>', 'Sublime junk.Hope the song is up to it!', '2011-06-19 07:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447286, 957222, 39880, '<td valign="top">This one reminds me of the old joke where there is a list of things on how to impress a woman and one thing for how to impress a man, Show up naked. Bring beer.<br/> <br/>I think the lighting is it bit harsh.  Softer light would help.  Nice even light on her face would be nice.</td>', 'This one reminds me of the old joke where there is a list of things on how to impress a woman and one thing for how to impress a man, Show up naked. Bring beer. I think the lighting is it bit harsh.  Softer light would help.  Nice even light on her face would be nice.', '2011-06-19 12:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447323, 956492, 12611, '<td valign="top">HDR oversaturated madness- I love it- huge depth/</td>', 'HDR oversaturated madness- I love it- huge depth/', '2011-06-19 13:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447324, 957023, 12611, '<td valign="top">it all works, and is frankly, much better than a kinkade painting at transferring mood<strike></strike></td>', 'it all works, and is frankly, much better than a kinkade painting at transferring mood', '2011-06-19 13:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447326, 957093, 12611, '<td valign="top">great color/ composition is good as well.</td>', 'great color/ composition is good as well.', '2011-06-19 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447328, 957222, 12611, '<td valign="top">penelope cruz? nice whimsical take on the song.</td>', 'penelope cruz? nice whimsical take on the song.', '2011-06-19 13:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447332, 957108, 12611, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity and focus of this shot.</td>', 'Like the simplicity and focus of this shot.', '2011-06-19 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447335, 957161, 12611, '<td valign="top">a bit disturbing.</td>', 'a bit disturbing.', '2011-06-19 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447336, 956661, 12611, '<td valign="top">This would look great huge! awesome color scale/</td>', 'This would look great huge! awesome color scale/', '2011-06-19 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447337, 957270, 12611, '<td valign="top">i am not so certain about those sandals. I think the whole shot may be a bit blown out as well. I like the subglasses and hat though:-)</td>', 'i am not so certain about those sandals. I think the whole shot may be a bit blown out as well. I like the subglasses and hat though:-)', '2011-06-19 13:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447405, 956798, 67258, '<td valign="top">Incredible, superb, wow!</td>', 'Incredible, superb, wow!', '2011-06-19 16:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447406, 956877, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting - super photo.</td>', 'Love the lighting - super photo.', '2011-06-19 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447410, 957179, 67258, '<td valign="top">Jelena?  June in Cambridge can''t be beaten! I do like the way the processing gives it a storybook feel.</td>', 'Jelena?  June in Cambridge can''t be beaten! I do like the way the processing gives it a storybook feel.', '2011-06-19 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447411, 956791, 67258, '<td valign="top">But for the dollar signs on the poster, I would have sworn this was in England!  Nicely observed.</td>', 'But for the dollar signs on the poster, I would have sworn this was in England!  Nicely observed.', '2011-06-19 16:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447418, 957260, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is a contemporary Cornish painter, <a href="//www.redraggallery.co.uk/artist-john-piper.asp" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">John Piper</a> whose paintings are so similar - I have one hanging in my sitting room!</td>', 'There is a contemporary Cornish painter, John Piper whose paintings are so similar - I have one hanging in my sitting room!', '2011-06-19 16:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447535, 956883, 12611, '<td valign="top">A fitting song for Anthony Weiner. Nice one.</td>', 'A fitting song for Anthony Weiner. Nice one.', '2011-06-19 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447736, 956668, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of the mountain against the sky, and the bird is such a nice touch!</td>', 'I love the crispness of the mountain against the sky, and the bird is such a nice touch!', '2011-06-19 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447737, 957108, 132996, '<td valign="top">Wonderful depth of field. I love the contrast on this also.</td>', 'Wonderful depth of field. I love the contrast on this also.', '2011-06-19 22:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447739, 956798, 132996, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning capture. I love the high-key light also.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning capture. I love the high-key light also.', '2011-06-19 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447741, 957276, 132996, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh. The face is hilarious. :D</td>', 'Oh my gosh. The face is hilarious. :D', '2011-06-19 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447749, 957163, 132996, '<td valign="top">I''m really liking this. The motion of the bird really adds something I think and the lack of any true whites gives it a vintage feel.</td>', 'I''m really liking this. The motion of the bird really adds something I think and the lack of any true whites gives it a vintage feel.', '2011-06-19 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447751, 957143, 132996, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the style of this reminds me of <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=-eaVOYizc80" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ezhik v tumane</a>...I like it. :D</td>', 'For some reason, the style of this reminds me of Ezhik v tumane...I like it. :D', '2011-06-19 22:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448140, 956865, 66709, '<td valign="top">pausilypon</td>', 'pausilypon', '2011-06-20 08:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448192, 957255, 12611, '<td valign="top">The blue and yellow contrast is mesmerizing here. Horizon is a bit tilted and its a bit centered for my taste; but its still a fantastic shot.</td>', 'The blue and yellow contrast is mesmerizing here. Horizon is a bit tilted and its a bit centered for my taste; but its still a fantastic shot.', '2011-06-20 09:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448193, 957027, 12611, '<td valign="top">or "Amos Moses" by Jerry Reed.</td>', 'or "Amos Moses" by Jerry Reed.', '2011-06-20 09:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448217, 956526, 12611, '<td valign="top">a real 50''s almost Bill Holiday feel to it. old newspaper or magazine pulled from the archives. brilliant.</td>', 'a real 50''s almost Bill Holiday feel to it. old newspaper or magazine pulled from the archives. brilliant.', '2011-06-20 09:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448221, 957249, 12611, '<td valign="top">Captain Satanic Knot Man; I love it. I am not sure how really photographic let-alone artist it is but it is interesting, to say the least.</td>', 'Captain Satanic Knot Man; I love it. I am not sure how really photographic let-alone artist it is but it is interesting, to say the least.', '2011-06-20 09:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448224, 956798, 12611, '<td valign="top">Perfection. I can''t remember a bird shot this good. The border, the contrast, the fish! A solid 10/</td>', 'Perfection. I can''t remember a bird shot this good. The border, the contrast, the fish! A solid 10/', '2011-06-20 09:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448229, 956761, 12611, '<td valign="top">great lighting; this just looks and feels so modern, such a great feel of an album cover- wonderful work here.</td>', 'great lighting; this just looks and feels so modern, such a great feel of an album cover- wonderful work here.', '2011-06-20 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448233, 957238, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines; fantastic blue and waves in the foreground; and although its a touch unorthodox, the lavender sky works really well; This photo opens up like a fine wine; I hope others take the time to stare at it a bit, instead of voting based upon the thumbnail...</td>', 'Great leading lines; fantastic blue and waves in the foreground; and although its a touch unorthodox, the lavender sky works really well; This photo opens up like a fine wine; I hope others take the time to stare at it a bit, instead of voting based upon the thumbnail...', '2011-06-20 09:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448234, 956953, 12611, '<td valign="top">I have to hand it to you- the detail work is phenomenal; the shadows of the pieces on the shirt really sell the reality of the shot. A bit oversold on the expression? -maybe- but its still a powerful entry.</td>', 'I have to hand it to you- the detail work is phenomenal; the shadows of the pieces on the shirt really sell the reality of the shot. A bit oversold on the expression? -maybe- but its still a powerful entry.', '2011-06-20 09:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448238, 957114, 12611, '<td valign="top">Oddly enough, this is a great image, and a ribbon winning 10. However, the shot is only made better by the similar themed shot in the challenge. The detail on the girl here is fantastic. the puzzle overlay on the spots that aren''t outlined, Brilliant. The composition feels like a surrealist painting; the shadow of the man to the right, the wedding dress mannequin, and to top it all off the beautiful yellow stucco masonry arches with water view reflected... This is an 11/</td>', 'Oddly enough, this is a great image, and a ribbon winning 10. However, the shot is only made better by the similar themed shot in the challenge. The detail on the girl here is fantastic. the puzzle overlay on the spots that aren''t outlined, Brilliant. The composition feels like a surrealist painting; the shadow of the man to the right, the wedding dress mannequin, and to top it all off the beautiful yellow stucco masonry arches with water view reflected... This is an 11/', '2011-06-20 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448240, 957072, 12611, '<td valign="top">Tibetan monk feel to this one. The Dalai Lama would approve, as well as Dolly Parton! Seriously, there is a terrific surrealist feel to this, almost a mixed media touch- best of luck with this one.</td>', 'Tibetan monk feel to this one. The Dalai Lama would approve, as well as Dolly Parton! Seriously, there is a terrific surrealist feel to this, almost a mixed media touch- best of luck with this one.', '2011-06-20 10:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448241, 957143, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the shot (though, a train is critical to the song,) but otherwise, the contrast, and the tree on the right is brilliant.</td>', 'I like the shot (though, a train is critical to the song,) but otherwise, the contrast, and the tree on the right is brilliant.', '2011-06-20 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448242, 957264, 27812, '<td valign="top">Please teach me how to do this?</td>', 'Please teach me how to do this?', '2011-06-20 10:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448244, 956806, 12611, '<td valign="top">great title.</td>', 'great title.', '2011-06-20 10:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448287, 956798, 113156, '<td valign="top">For me this has to be the most elegant bird there is and you captured it brilliantly. (voted earlier)</td>', 'For me this has to be the most elegant bird there is and you captured it brilliantly. (voted earlier)', '2011-06-20 10:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448301, 957264, 113156, '<td valign="top">I must try doing this one day. The bull looks like its jumping out of the photo and the PP is spot on.</td>', 'I must try doing this one day. The bull looks like its jumping out of the photo and the PP is spot on.', '2011-06-20 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448335, 956953, 109387, '<td valign="top">The idea was ok, but the editing is not at same level.</td>', 'The idea was ok, but the editing is not at same level.', '2011-06-20 12:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448362, 957023, 109387, '<td valign="top">It could be an 8, but there are a few things that I don''t like: The lower part of the moon, the trees on the right and the stars. An hour more in front of your computer and you could get a great work.</td>', 'It could be an 8, but there are a few things that I don''t like: The lower part of the moon, the trees on the right and the stars. An hour more in front of your computer and you could get a great work.', '2011-06-20 12:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448372, 956661, 86340, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite songs by my favorite artist! Nice shot, but I''m not sure the portrait orientation works for me, nor the border. Great colors and I do like the mountains at the very bottom. Not voting.</td>', 'One of my favorite songs by my favorite artist! Nice shot, but I''m not sure the portrait orientation works for me, nor the border. Great colors and I do like the mountains at the very bottom. Not voting.', '2011-06-20 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448393, 957255, 109387, '<td valign="top">I can see something very strange in the sky (maybe you used the clone stamp tool). Good idea, but bad editing.</td>', 'I can see something very strange in the sky (maybe you used the clone stamp tool). Good idea, but bad editing.', '2011-06-20 13:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448396, 957264, 109387, '<td valign="top">Muuuuch better without the animal, IMHO.</td>', 'Muuuuch better without the animal, IMHO.', '2011-06-20 13:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448441, 957230, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good try, but I can''t come up with any songs that have this title. Cool abstract, however.</td>', 'Good try, but I can''t come up with any songs that have this title. Cool abstract, however.', '2011-06-20 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448478, 957182, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and the framing with the flag is excellent I just wish the lighting on the gun and helmet was more pronounced, as it is the details gets lost in the shadows.</td>', 'I like the idea here and the framing with the flag is excellent I just wish the lighting on the gun and helmet was more pronounced, as it is the details gets lost in the shadows.', '2011-06-20 14:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448479, 956492, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like this, the dynamic range is wonderful and lighting is great.</td>', 'I like this, the dynamic range is wonderful and lighting is great.', '2011-06-20 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448480, 957273, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like how this is one of those shots where the viewer can each see something different as they explore it.</td>', 'I like how this is one of those shots where the viewer can each see something different as they explore it.', '2011-06-20 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448481, 957274, 113278, '<td valign="top">I am going through and commenting on everything and this one just doesn''t say anything to me. Not bad not good(for me) just kind of down the middle. Good luck.</td>', 'I am going through and commenting on everything and this one just doesn''t say anything to me. Not bad not good(for me) just kind of down the middle. Good luck.', '2011-06-20 15:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448482, 957257, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice work, I think I liked the composition on your original shot better but I think the ghostly moods fits the title and hopefully others will see that as well. Good luck. Not voting.</td>', 'Nice work, I think I liked the composition on your original shot better but I think the ghostly moods fits the title and hopefully others will see that as well. Good luck. Not voting.', '2011-06-20 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448483, 957013, 113278, '<td valign="top">Is that a shoe<strike>fly</strike>horn? It is a fantastic photo and I really like the color. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Is that a shoeflyhorn? It is a fantastic photo and I really like the color. Hope you do well.', '2011-06-20 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448484, 957260, 113278, '<td valign="top">Wicked shot, dark and ghostly and a bit mysterious.</td>', 'Wicked shot, dark and ghostly and a bit mysterious.', '2011-06-20 15:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448486, 957180, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic clouds and that light is awesome. Only thing for me is it seems a bit noisy.</td>', 'Great dramatic clouds and that light is awesome. Only thing for me is it seems a bit noisy.', '2011-06-20 15:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448487, 957270, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the rope for the ring of fire. For me this shot seems out of place. It looks like you are in a fenced in back yard and you have some "cowboy" stuff on then you have flip flops and sunglasses at night. Sorry it just doesn''t seem to flow well for me. Best of luck.</td>', 'I like how you used the rope for the ring of fire. For me this shot seems out of place. It looks like you are in a fenced in back yard and you have some "cowboy" stuff on then you have flip flops and sunglasses at night. Sorry it just doesn''t seem to flow well for me. Best of luck.', '2011-06-20 15:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448488, 956398, 113278, '<td valign="top">Talk about razor sharp depth of field, perhaps too shallow? But you nailed the focus on what needed to be in focus so good job.</td>', 'Talk about razor sharp depth of field, perhaps too shallow? But you nailed the focus on what needed to be in focus so good job.', '2011-06-20 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448489, 957223, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting, it looks well shot but I don''t really get the image as a whole. Oh well, good luck to you.</td>', 'I like your lighting, it looks well shot but I don''t really get the image as a whole. Oh well, good luck to you.', '2011-06-20 15:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448492, 957238, 113278, '<td valign="top">What a scenic vista. I love the composition on this.</td>', 'What a scenic vista. I love the composition on this.', '2011-06-20 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448494, 957276, 113278, '<td valign="top">Love the face you put on the bug. Good for a laugh.</td>', 'Love the face you put on the bug. Good for a laugh.', '2011-06-20 15:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448495, 956852, 113278, '<td valign="top">I think this is simple but well done. Nice use of the depth of field.</td>', 'I think this is simple but well done. Nice use of the depth of field.', '2011-06-20 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448496, 956799, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition and good exposure.', '2011-06-20 15:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448498, 957093, 113278, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like how close you shot this and the title could be a stretch as it seems more about the boat and less about the water, could have used the boat song or boat of life?? Either way good luck.</td>', 'Not sure I like how close you shot this and the title could be a stretch as it seems more about the boat and less about the water, could have used the boat song or boat of life?? Either way good luck.', '2011-06-20 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448499, 957053, 113278, '<td valign="top">Hard to convey thunder in a photo as you can only hear it. I love the lighting on the horses but the clouds and lighting seem out of place. Maybe it''s just me. Good luck.</td>', 'Hard to convey thunder in a photo as you can only hear it. I love the lighting on the horses but the clouds and lighting seem out of place. Maybe it''s just me. Good luck.', '2011-06-20 15:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448500, 957160, 113278, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and I love how you used the focus here.</td>', 'Interesting shot and I love how you used the focus here.', '2011-06-20 15:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448501, 957075, 113278, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a fotomann shot. Well done but it doesn''t seem like she is down in a ditch. A 9 for great photography but for me the title doesn''t fit so a 7 overall.</td>', 'This has the makings of a fotomann shot. Well done but it doesn''t seem like she is down in a ditch. A 9 for great photography but for me the title doesn''t fit so a 7 overall.', '2011-06-20 15:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448502, 956865, 113278, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location and nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful location and nice composition.', '2011-06-20 15:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448503, 956451, 113278, '<td valign="top">I have been looking at this awhile and I am torn as to wether or not I like it. It seems like a snapshot but then it also has this artistic quality to it, so confused.</td>', 'I have been looking at this awhile and I am torn as to wether or not I like it. It seems like a snapshot but then it also has this artistic quality to it, so confused.', '2011-06-20 15:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448504, 957265, 113278, '<td valign="top">Well composed and lit, and you have so interesting and cool poses going on. I like it.</td>', 'Well composed and lit, and you have so interesting and cool poses going on. I like it.', '2011-06-20 15:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448506, 957184, 113278, '<td valign="top">For me I just find this a bit too dark and as such it doesn''t pull me in.</td>', 'For me I just find this a bit too dark and as such it doesn''t pull me in.', '2011-06-20 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448507, 957189, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice shot the exposure seems well done but i find it neither dull nor exceptional, good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot the exposure seems well done but i find it neither dull nor exceptional, good luck.', '2011-06-20 15:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448510, 957264, 113278, '<td valign="top">These shots are fun but often they all look very similar but I think the bull statue really makes a difference. Well done.</td>', 'These shots are fun but often they all look very similar but I think the bull statue really makes a difference. Well done.', '2011-06-20 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448512, 957143, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and dark moody feel.</td>', 'Nice processing and dark moody feel.', '2011-06-20 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448513, 956503, 113278, '<td valign="top">I love how the light is in this but the title may be a bit of a stretch.</td>', 'I love how the light is in this but the title may be a bit of a stretch.', '2011-06-20 15:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448514, 957272, 113278, '<td valign="top">This is great,</td>', 'This is great,', '2011-06-20 15:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
