(6451347, 957023, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great image Jenn.  I love all the different elements, and how you put them together.  A great response to the expert editing options. (Not voting)<br/> <br/>Edited to correct typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-24 11:13:32.</i></td>', 'Great image Jenn.  I love all the different elements, and how you put them together.  A great response to the expert editing options. (Not voting) Edited to correct typo', '2011-06-24 00:05:21.000000', '2011-06-24 12:13:32.000000', 1),
(6451349, 957255, 104230, '<td valign="top">So that''s where you go for answers. I find this a compelling image.  I like the strong colors, the cobalt blue and the lime-yellow green. The wind turbines seem to be dancing.  What a wonderful stage for their performance.</td>', 'So that''s where you go for answers. I find this a compelling image.  I like the strong colors, the cobalt blue and the lime-yellow green. The wind turbines seem to be dancing.  What a wonderful stage for their performance.', '2011-06-24 00:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451351, 957189, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the composition, the colors and the processing. The boat has beautiful lines too.  I''ll be interested to find out where this was taken.<br/> <br/>ETA:  I guess this is a yacht, not just "a boat"!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-25 14:48:50.</i></td>', 'Nice, I like the composition, the colors and the processing. The boat has beautiful lines too.  I''ll be interested to find out where this was taken. ETA:  I guess this is a yacht, not just "a boat"!', '2011-06-24 00:07:32.000000', '2011-06-25 15:48:50.000000', 1),
(6451352, 957154, 104230, '<td valign="top">Very effective, great use of expert editing options, I love how the silhouette anchors the image in the lower left area while the road and fence lead you through the rest of the image. Great mistiness in the background.</td>', 'Very effective, great use of expert editing options, I love how the silhouette anchors the image in the lower left area while the road and fence lead you through the rest of the image. Great mistiness in the background.', '2011-06-24 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
