(6451495, 957163, 54645, '<td valign="top">I love <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=11769" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jmritz</a> comment. Beautiful Lev as always.</td>', 'I love  jmritz comment. Beautiful Lev as always.', '2011-06-24 01:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6451496, 957219, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bobnospum:</b></div><hr/><i> Odd.  I think the boat and ghosts would have made a nice image.  The lightening, the person, and the lighthouse just make it go over the top into the slightly silly category. </i></td></tr></table><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> You could''ve left out the ghosts, ship and lightning and I would have added 2 points to the score. Sometimes less is more. Still a great job. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL - you''ll never please everyone. :) Congrats on 4th, although I''m guessing you may be in for some front page withdrawals eventually. Thenk again, that probably won''t happen. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by bobnospum: Odd.  I think the boat and ghosts would have made a nice image.  The lightening, the person, and the lighthouse just make it go over the top into the slightly silly category. Originally posted by Art Roflmao: You could''ve left out the ghosts, ship and lightning and I would have added 2 points to the score. Sometimes less is more. Still a great job.   LOL - you''ll never please everyone. :) Congrats on 4th, although I''m guessing you may be in for some front page withdrawals eventually. Thenk again, that probably won''t happen. :)', '2011-06-24 01:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
