(6451808, 957219, 38032, '<td valign="top">I would agree. Some amazing ideas that seem to be somewhat overly overlapped ;)  Great image nonetheless - we have come to expect perfection from you ! - not exactly easy to live up to your own reputation ;)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> You could''ve left out the ghosts, ship and lightning and I would have added 2 points to the score. Sometimes less is more. Still a great job. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I would agree. Some amazing ideas that seem to be somewhat overly overlapped ;)  Great image nonetheless - we have come to expect perfection from you ! - not exactly easy to live up to your own reputation ;) Originally posted by Art Roflmao: You could''ve left out the ghosts, ship and lightning and I would have added 2 points to the score. Sometimes less is more. Still a great job. ', '2011-06-24 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 0),
