(6455238, 957154, 62187, '<td valign="top">imho, the photos rated higher then your photo, while they had ''country song titles'', said nothing to me of ''country music'' which I believe was at the root and true heart of the challenge.  Expert editing? ehh, not a fan of it - it''s not photography to me. To me, your photo looks like it could have been achieved with a tripod and long exposure. So, I think your photo should have been the blue ribbon winner. But what does a snapshot-taker like me know...?</td>', 'imho, the photos rated higher then your photo, while they had ''country song titles'', said nothing to me of ''country music'' which I believe was at the root and true heart of the challenge.  Expert editing? ehh, not a fan of it - it''s not photography to me. To me, your photo looks like it could have been achieved with a tripod and long exposure. So, I think your photo should have been the blue ribbon winner. But what does a snapshot-taker like me know...?', '2011-06-28 22:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
