(6472083, 957157, 86218, '<td valign="top">Hey Herman. Sien nou eers hierdie foto nadat ek weer op jou profile gaan rondkrap het. Welgedaan met die foto reeks van die maan en uitslag op die challenge<br/> <br/>Groetnis</td>', 'Hey Herman. Sien nou eers hierdie foto nadat ek weer op jou profile gaan rondkrap het. Welgedaan met die foto reeks van die maan en uitslag op die challenge Groetnis', '2011-07-16 07:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477328, 957023, 49683, '<td valign="top">This image has almost an escher like quality in that it bends reality into a dream state.</td>', 'This image has almost an escher like quality in that it bends reality into a dream state.', '2011-07-20 22:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477330, 957274, 49683, '<td valign="top">man in black, ring of fire.  Would of been fun if he was in the centre of the ring.</td>', 'man in black, ring of fire.  Would of been fun if he was in the centre of the ring.', '2011-07-20 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6513928, 957157, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely work Herman. Great result. I know all too well how hard this is. At least I used one camera and one lens on a tripod during the 4 hour shoot so when layering didn''t have the troubles you did. Love that you got the stars in the background.<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/magnum_za/5840784303/in/photostream" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm4.static.flickr.com/3196/5840784303_9154f4b9c3_m.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm4.static.flickr.com/3196/5840784303_9154f4b9c3_m.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm4.static.flickr.com/3196/5840784303_9154f4b9c3_m.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Lovely work Herman. Great result. I know all too well how hard this is. At least I used one camera and one lens on a tripod during the 4 hour shoot so when layering didn''t have the troubles you did. Love that you got the stars in the background.', '2011-08-24 06:40:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6525146, 957023, 137320, '<td valign="top">Love this! I ran into the same issue of making the moon fit in realistically in a picture very similar to this similar. Everything else is perfect. I especially like that the viewer''s eye is drawn equally to the two main themes in the title (walking, and midnight) Truly a magnificent image!</td>', 'Love this! I ran into the same issue of making the moon fit in realistically in a picture very similar to this similar. Everything else is perfect. I especially like that the viewer''s eye is drawn equally to the two main themes in the title (walking, and midnight) Truly a magnificent image!', '2011-09-02 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6618078, 957023, 104920, '<td valign="top">you are amazing! this is great!</td>', 'you are amazing! this is great!', '2011-12-14 07:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6909473, 956798, 67258, '<td valign="top">Glad to see this one again - impressed me hugely the first time.</td>', 'Glad to see this one again - impressed me hugely the first time.', '2012-11-20 11:00:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6909522, 956798, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good one!</td>', 'Good one!', '2012-11-20 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6912563, 956517, 3936, '<td valign="top">I have to agree, the light is wonderful.  I find myself wanting a little burning of the green leafy part, and maybe also the brown behind it.  The yellow flow of the flower base is magical.</td>', 'I have to agree, the light is wonderful.  I find myself wanting a little burning of the green leafy part, and maybe also the brown behind it.  The yellow flow of the flower base is magical.', '2012-11-24 16:58:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6959501, 957260, 67258, '<td valign="top">Revisiting - and still I love this as much as on first viewing. Indeed, with each viewing I find new layers and subtleties.</td>', 'Revisiting - and still I love this as much as on first viewing. Indeed, with each viewing I find new layers and subtleties.', '2013-01-17 05:28:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7102613, 957092, 152252, '<td valign="top">Haha, love it. Thanks for a good laugh. I think the choice of post processing works great here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-09-13 17:36:59.</i></td>', 'Haha, love it. Thanks for a good laugh. I think the choice of post processing works great here.', '2013-09-13 18:36:12.000000', '2013-09-13 18:36:59.000000', 0);
